WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:04.000
The X profile is shown before checkout.

00:04.000 --> 00:10.500
The subscription payment is submitted
on X's checkout page.

00:10.500 --> 00:14.500
X's checkout shows “Processing”.

00:14.500 --> 00:26.500
The profile is checked again
after the payment step.

00:26.500 --> 00:31.000
The profile page is reloaded
to check the updated status.

00:31.000 --> 00:35.773
A blue verification badge is now visible
beside the profile name.